    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-error-class threshold override. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When an error class has an entry here its failures are counted separately against <computeroutput>threshold</computeroutput>. A class whose consecutive failure count reaches its threshold immediately trips the circuit even if the global counter has not yet reached <computeroutput>failure_threshold</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
